    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42663" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sarrītor</span></b>  (collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sartor</span></b> ),
		ōris, m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A hoer</i>, <i>weeder</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 1, 29, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 2, 13, 1</span></i>.—*
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sator sartorque scelerum et messor maxime,</span>”
				i. e. <i>cultivator</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Capt. 3, 5, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
